From 70ce22c98dd6cc927e8614460510f179fd7578ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SEGURIDAD-PORTES-33 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 13:08:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] v8: initialize the regexp capture_name_map once (381fb31a06,
 crbug 587212489)

Port of V8 15.9 merge 381fb31a06 (M159; cherry-pick of main f81569975b),
adapted to 15.6 (context only; same added and removed lines).
Recompiling a regexp for another subject encoding re-parsed the
in-sandbox source and overwrote capture_name_map, so a sandbox write
could clear or change it mid-execution or after caching the result.
Fill it once at creation, read it once in SearchRegExpMultiple, and
cache the results under regexp_data->wrapper().
